{title: Payale Chunmun Chunmun}
{artist: Anu Malik Kumar Sanu}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Payalay [Dm]chunmun [Am]chunmun,        [Am]Jhanjare [Dm]runjhun [Am]runjhun
[C]Kitna madhur hai yeh mi [Am]lan,        [Am]Chan chanana [Em]choori [Am]bole
[Am]San sanana [Em]purva [Am]dole,        [Am]Gunje ye [D]dharthi aur gagan [Am]nn
[E]Kabhi chal [Am]thi ho cham cham,        [E]Kabhi chal [Am]thi ho tham tham
[Am]Dhadaktha [F]dil hai dham dham,        [E]Jo pyar mein
[E]Nadi behethi [Am]hai jhar jhar,        [E]Hawa kehethi [Am]hai sar sar
[F]Hateli baath ghar ghar,        [E]Baykar mein
[Am]Goriya [E]gaye [Am]gun gun,        [Am]Sajana [E]jhoomein [Am]sun sun
[Am]Pyar me [D]koi hai milan [Am]nn,        [E]Ye baiya [Am]gori gori
[E]Mai thamu [Am]chori chori,        [Am]Zara soon [F]ori ori
[E]suntho zara aa,        [E]Rahe tu [Am]meheki meheki aa
[E]Chale tu [Am]beheki beheki aaa,        [Am]Lage tu [F]leheki leheki aaa
[E]Mujako sada aa,        [Am]Lau me [E]kaliya chum chum
[Am]Baje ek tara [E]thum thum,        [Am]Dono hi [D]sunke ho mag [Am]gan
